WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.070
Order!

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.210
Order in the court!

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:07.820
Today, we are sentencing the most nefarious
group of criminals to ever sail the Grand

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.820
Line.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:14.799
We, the court of Enies Lobby, on behalf of
the prosecution: The World Government, hereby

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:21.930
pronounce the Straw Hat Pirates: Monkey D.
Luffy, Roronoa Zoro, Vinsmoke Sanji, Cat Burglar

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:29.390
Nami, Tony Tony Chopper, Nico Robin, Cutty
Flam AKA Cyborg Franky, Soul King Brook, and

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.310
former Warlord Jinbei guilty…of: everything.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:32.310
Theft.

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.310
Kidnapping.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.310
Murder.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.310
All of the crimes.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:41.000
Death is too lenient a punishment for them,
so these criminals will be locked up in Impel

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.460
Down - and Monkey D. Luffy: don’t even think
about another prison break.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.630
We’ve upgraded security and the Warden will
be keeping a close eye on you in the newly

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:58.079
constructed Level 7, which Straw Hat, I assure
you is a very, very bad place with no meat

00:00:58.079 --> 00:00:59.079
at all.

00:00:59.079 --> 00:01:02.420
The time you all will spend there totals 7,821
years.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:38.300
So - Here is the list of all crimes committed
by the straw hat pirates:

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.490
Captain Monkey D. Luffy, son of Dragon the
revolutionary.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:48.250
At the age of seven, this future pirate committed
Grand Larceny when he stole and consumed an

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:54.620
exceedingly rare and valuable devil fruit
from the Emperor of the Sea Red Haired Shanks.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.969
Six years.

00:01:55.969 --> 00:02:00.250
Grand Larceny, by the way, which I’ve heard
in like a million TV shows apparently means

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.880
theft of something worth a total of $50,000
or more.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:10.789
A devil fruit definitely seems rare enough
to qualify.

00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:12.040
Roronoa Zoro.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:17.569
Once a promising bounty hunter working against
the pirate menace, it seems he changed his

00:02:17.569 --> 00:02:22.910
ways when he murdered a dog belonging to Lieutenant
Commander Helmeppo of the Marines.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:28.970
And in the court of public opinion, murdering
a dog is an even more heinous action than

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:30.600
killing a humans.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.530
10 years.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:37.870
During Zoro’s subsequent imprisonment, Luffy
illegally freed him, a crime worthy of five

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:38.870
years in prison.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:42.950
He then resisted arrest - this will be a common
theme in this video.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.709
They resist arrest just about everywhere they
go.

00:02:45.709 --> 00:02:48.610
An additional year for each of them.

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:51.620
Both of these pirates assaulted multiple officers
of the law.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:55.530
At two years per Marine punched, an additional
twenty years.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:03:00.930
And, on top of it all, Luffy destroyed public
property in the form of a giant statue of

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.110
Captain Axe-Hand Morgan.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.129
Ten years.

00:03:05.129 --> 00:03:12.959
Settle in, everyone, because that’s 53 years
already and we’ve barely even gotten started.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.650
Now - Cat Burglar Nami.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.470
Don’t think we’ve forgotten about her.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:20.360
For petty theft of a Grand Line map from Buggy
the Clown, one year.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:25.030
That’s in addition to stealing a boat from
his crewmates in what amounts to Grand Theft

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.030
Auto.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.030
Er - Grand Theft…Naval.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.030
2.5 years.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:31.500
Did you know that Grand Theft Auto actually
does include boats?

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.500
Fun fact.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:37.769
That’s not to mention another instance of
Grand Theft Naval against her own soon-to-be

00:03:37.769 --> 00:03:39.840
crewmates on the Baratie.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:40.849
Another 2.5 years.

00:03:40.849 --> 00:03:46.420
And Nami also assaulted an officer of the
marines in Cocoyashi Village - that’s another

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:47.420
2 years.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:51.319
Of course, that’s not to mention the 100
million berries that the Cat Burglar stole

00:03:51.319 --> 00:03:52.860
all across the Grand Line.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:57.971
And while these berries were themselves stolen
from pirates, stealing is wrong and the World

00:03:57.971 --> 00:04:00.829
Government just wouldn’t tolerate that kind
of behavior.

00:04:00.829 --> 00:04:05.120
This is the crew’s second instance of Grand
Larceny which makes for an additional six

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.780
years.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:11.849
Vinsmoke Sanji - as a chef on the floating
restaurant, Baratie, assaulted a ranking marine

00:04:11.849 --> 00:04:16.579
officer, Lieutenant Commander Fullbody. 2
years.

00:04:16.579 --> 00:04:20.169
Also on Baratie, I have reports here that
Straw Hat Luffy caused property damage by

00:04:20.169 --> 00:04:25.639
firing a cannon ball into the restaurant and
that he also broke many dishes and snuck several

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:27.400
plates of food without paying.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:33.240
However, Zeff decided not to press charges,
so no worries.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:39.229
In Loguetown, the entire Straw Hat crew, consisting
of five members at that point once again resisted

00:04:39.229 --> 00:04:41.570
arrest, this time by Captain Smoker.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:45.720
That’s two years for each of them, so an
additional ten years.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:51.199
That’s 79 years in Impel Down and the Straw
Hats haven’t even arrived in the Grand Line

00:04:51.199 --> 00:04:52.199
yet.

00:04:52.199 --> 00:04:56.430
And once the Straw Hats arrived in the Grand
Line, their crimes became much grander as

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.430
well.

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:02.210
I will dismiss Roronoa Zoro’s 100 murders
on Whiskey Peak, due to that being a case

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.210
of self-defense.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:06.400
However, that doesn’t make things any better
for the crew.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:10.919
After arriving in the Sakura Kingdom, formerly
known as the Drum Kingdom, the crew committed

00:05:10.919 --> 00:05:15.919
treason against the World Government by deposing
Wapol, Drum’s sovereign monarch.

00:05:15.919 --> 00:05:20.229
That’s going to be the first of many life
sentences for Straw Hat Luffy.

00:05:20.229 --> 00:05:25.860
We’re just going to say a life sentence
in One Piece is 100 years since the lifespans

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.289
are a bit different than the real world’s.

00:05:28.289 --> 00:05:35.041
Also, I am 100% on a list somewhere after
googling how many years I would get in prison

00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:42.069
for punching various world leaders.

00:05:42.069 --> 00:05:46.090
In the Kingdom of Alabasta, Monkey D. Luffy
and his crew of five additional pirates are

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:51.759
each charged with resisting arrest twice,
once in Nanohana and again in the city of

00:05:51.759 --> 00:05:53.820
Rainbase. 20 years.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:06:00.560
That’s not to mention the immense property
damage in the Capital of Alubarna - one year.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:07.110
As well as damage caused to the Tomb of the
King, a certified historical site - an additional

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.110
year.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:12.440
And, of course, there’s the defeat of Sir
Crocodile, one of the Seven Warlords of the

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:16.740
Sea, a crime for which there is little precedent.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:21.500
We’ll say a Warlord is worth half of a monarch.
50 years.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:27.240
And on top of it all, there was the worst
crime of all: dining and dashing in Nanohana.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.720
Yet another year.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:33.080
Upon fleeing from Alabasta, they once again
evaded capture, but this time they fled the

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.419
scene with the aid of a vehicle.

00:06:35.419 --> 00:06:39.800
This actually leads to a harsher sentence
due to the expenditure of government resources

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.840
in the pursuit as well as the increased danger
to law enforcement and civilians.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:48.780
That’s six years for each crew member, which
now includes Nico Robin.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:51.810
That’s another 36 years.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:57.220
This brings the total charges to 288 years.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.380
Starting to sweat, Straw Hats?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.900
Because this is just a drop in the bucket.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.680
Let us proceed with the charges.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:09.889
On the island of Jaya, Monkey D. Luffy is
guilty of aggravated assault against Bellamy

00:07:09.889 --> 00:07:10.889
the Hyena.

00:07:10.889 --> 00:07:15.259
It just goes to show that no matter how punchable
someone’s face is, you can’t just go around

00:07:15.259 --> 00:07:16.970
one-shotting people.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.930
5 years.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:23.750
Skypiea is not a member nation of the World
Government, but the Straw Hats also wreaked

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.069
havoc above the clouds.

00:07:25.069 --> 00:07:30.440
To begin with, they denied paying the entrance
fee of one billion extols.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.590
One year for bypassing tolls.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:37.319
They also assaulted many officers of the law,
including Nami ramming the captain of the

00:07:37.319 --> 00:07:42.020
White Berets with a vehicle called a waver.
6 years for assaulting the White Berets and

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.490
an additional 7 for vehicular assault.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:49.169
In addition to all of this, the Straw Hats
entered the restricted location called the

00:07:49.169 --> 00:07:52.370
Upper Yard in an example of illegal border
crossing.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:54.560
1 more year.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:08:00.080
On the shipwright island of Water 7, Cyborg
Franky committed Grand Larceny when he stole

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:05.380
200 million berries from…the Straw Hats…before
he joined.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:10.570
There’s a surprising amount of inter-crew
theft going on with the Straw Hats.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:15.039
I mean…it’s only two times, but it’s
weird that it happened twice.

00:08:15.039 --> 00:08:16.070
6 years.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:21.020
And then, oh, what do we have here…assaulting
officers of the world government.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:27.169
For Luffy, Zoro, and Franky attacking CP 9
agents in Water 7, 6 years.

00:08:27.169 --> 00:08:31.330
Then we have a case of destruction of property
where it seems that Luffy and Zoro demolished

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.260
two buildings in Water 7 during a natural
disaster.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:39.250
Turns out pirates are even more destructive
to Water 7 than the Agua Laguna.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.979
That will be an additional 5 years.

00:08:41.979 --> 00:08:46.950
Next, on the Sea Train known as Puffing Tom,
Vinsmoke Sanji and Cyborg Franky dispatched

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:54.080
several Cipher Pol agents, including Jerry
of CP 6, Wanze of CP7, Nero of CP9, and in

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:59.830
pursuit on a second Sea Train, Roronoa Zoro
defeated the late Vice Admiral T-Bone. 8 more

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:00.830
years.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.480
And that brings us…here.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.550
To the newly reconstructed Enies Lobby.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:09.450
Do you have any idea what the construction
costs are to place a building over a giant

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.860
gaping hole in the ocean?&nbsp;

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.550
They’re a lot.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:16.880
On the old Enies Lobby, all 8 of the Straw
Hats resisted arrest.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.170
That’s 8 years.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.850
All of them assaulted multiple marine officers.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:25.180
At an average of five soldiers and agents
attacked per crew member, that’s an additional

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.640
80 years.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:32.459
Freeing a prisoner is worth an additional
5 years, so for freeing both Cyborg Franky

00:09:32.459 --> 00:09:34.670
and Nico Robin, that’s another 10.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.310
Oh - And how could I forget.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.880
The big one.

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:44.290
For the illegal declaration of war against
the World Government, each member of the Straw

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:49.750
Hats earns an additional life sentence of
100 years.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:55.769
Another 800 years should give them plenty
of time to reflect on their actions.

00:09:55.769 --> 00:10:00.960
For anyone keeping track, that makes the total
charges thus far 1,230 years.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:05.320
And you may think, what’s the point of even
going further?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:08.820
Surely the Straw Hats will all rot in jail
if they’re there that long.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:14.260
Well, I regret to inform you that this is
still nothing compared to their heinous crimes

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:15.610
to come.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:20.899
Like the 50 years for taking Gecko Moriah
out of commission on Thriller Bark.

00:10:20.899 --> 00:10:27.180
But then we get to Sabaody Archipelago.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:32.210
Punching the king of a member nation of the
World Government like Wapol is one thing.

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:38.380
But the punching of St. Charlos, a Celestial
Dragon. 200 years.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:44.139
And, of course, there’s the 16 years - two
per crew member -&nbsp; for resisting arrest once

00:10:44.139 --> 00:10:45.139
again.

00:10:45.139 --> 00:10:48.770
And an additional year will be tacked on for
inciting a riot.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:52.530
That was a real mess that Kizaru and Kuma
had to clean up.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:57.820
After Sabaody Archipelago, Luffy booked a
direct flight to Amazon Lily, the island of

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:01.720
women, where he engaged in the high crime
of…being a man.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:06.000
How many years does a person get in prison
for being a man?

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:09.510
Oh well, I’m just going to say 20 years.

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:11.820
20 years for being a man.

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:15.470
And, Franky blew up one of Dr. Vegapunk’s
old labs on Baldimore.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:16.820
That’s another 2.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:22.430
And from one place where Luffy was absolutely
not supposed to be, he went straight to a

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:28.470
place he even more was absolutely not supposed
to be…and it says here on my forms that

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:35.100
he single-handedly conducted the largest breakout
in the entire history of Impel Down.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:39.540
Of course, involved in that Luffy has yet
again insulted officers and resisted arrest

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.760
and incited a riot.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:42.440
Those crimes are only 10 years.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:46.950
But the charge for freeing a prisoner is 5
years, as we’ve already covered.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.010
It says here you freed…241 prisoners.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:55.000
Let’s see…241 x 5…carry the one…that’s
another 1205 years.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.800
Of course, Straw Hat then went to the Marineford
War.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:03.180
He dropped a Marine ship onto the battlefield,
damaging government property to the tune of

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.180
10 years.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:08.010
He freed yet another prisoner, Portgas D.
Ace for another 5.

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:13.639
That comes to a total of 2,739 years in prison.

00:12:13.639 --> 00:12:16.519
And then, wow, I’m impressed.

00:12:16.519 --> 00:12:23.520
This pirate crew somehow managed to lay low
and didn’t commit any crimes for an entire

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.520
two years.

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:29.010
If they’d waited about 3 more years, they
could have beaten the statute of limitations

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:34.130
on some of these charges, but nope - they
just can’t help themselves.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.420
Pirates just love committing crimes, don’t
they?

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:41.100
Upon the Straw Hats’ return to Sabaody,
they destroyed government property in the

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:47.810
form of several Pacifistas and…what a shocker:
all 9 crew members resisted arrest.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.649
28 years.

00:12:49.649 --> 00:12:54.110
After that, it appears the crew traveled beneath
the Red Line to Fishman Island where they

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:59.670
… ah, committed a coup d’etat, tying up
the monarch of Fishman Island, King Neptune,

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.490
and taking over Ryugu Castle.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:07.269
For this attempted government takeover of
a member nation of the World Government, 20

00:13:07.269 --> 00:13:08.370
years.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:12.290
King Neptune decided not to press charges,
but this offense against the government will

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.910
not be tolerated at the brand new Enies Lobby
2.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:20.860
On the labs of Punk Hazard, the Straw Hats
destroyed scientific property as well as committed

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.670
aggravated assault against the scientist,
Caesar Clown.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.560
That will be an additional 7 years.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:31.899
And then moving over to Dressrosa, Luffy defeated
Donquixote Doflamingo.

00:13:31.899 --> 00:13:34.160
Doflamingo was not only a warlord.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:38.079
He was the monarch of a world government member
state.

00:13:38.079 --> 00:13:42.149
And on top of it all, he was a Celestial dragon.

00:13:42.149 --> 00:13:50.949
This means that his defeat has earned Luffy
a combined 350 additional years in Level 7

00:13:50.949 --> 00:13:51.949
of Impel Down.

00:13:51.949 --> 00:13:56.019
And, in what seems to happen everywhere this
crew goes, they resisted arrest, attacked

00:13:56.019 --> 00:13:58.209
marines, and incited riots and rebellions.

00:13:58.209 --> 00:14:01.430
20 years for the group.

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:06.269
On the Island of Zou…this can’t be right…it
appears the Straw Hats defied all logic and

00:14:06.269 --> 00:14:10.980
expectation and did not commit any crimes
on Zou.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.279
Unbelievable.

00:14:12.279 --> 00:14:16.910
After leaving Zou, the crew determined to
invade two Emperor Territories - those of

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.870
Big Mom and Kaidou respectively.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:23.920
These are not member states of the World Government,
however Cipher Pol agents were present on

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:28.730
both occasions to observe the crimes of the
Straw Hats, which were shockingly similar

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:29.970
in both territories.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:34.839
In both cases, the Straw Hats committed illegal
border crossings. 1 year each for the 10 crew

00:14:34.839 --> 00:14:35.839
members.

00:14:35.839 --> 00:14:38.870
In both cases, crew members stole large amounts
of food.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:39.870
1 year.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.550
In both cases, Monkey D. Luffy caused immense
property damage.

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:43.550
5 years.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:47.329
For inciting rebellion against the government
of Wano Country, 10 years.

00:14:47.329 --> 00:14:53.199
For aggravated assault against many, many
individuals: 30 years.

00:14:53.199 --> 00:14:59.730
And for wedding and/or party crashing…let’s
just say another year.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:05.830
And for creating a power vacuum in the world
powers by defeating Big Mom and Kaidou, an

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.180
additional 200 years.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:12.810
They are not World Government monarchs, but
they were crucial to balancing the complex

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:17.470
forces of the globe…and that balance is
now out the window.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:23.750
This brings us to Egghead Island, the government-owned
lab run by Dr. Vegapunk.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:28.649
For the combined crimes of resisting arrest,
attacking marine officers, breaking into a

00:15:28.649 --> 00:15:34.000
top-secret government facility, and aiding
a known criminal in the form of Dr. Vegapunk

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:40.570
who defied government orders…you’ve earned
an additional 150 years.

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:49.680
For attempting to attack one of the Five Elder
Stars, Jay Garcia Saturn, another 300 years.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:54.019
Of course, there are a few other high crimes
that the Straw Hats have committed.

00:15:54.019 --> 00:15:58.740
For flying the Jolly Roger and acting in defiance
of the World Government - 10 years for each

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.420
Straw Hat crew member.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.740
100 years.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:06.920
In addition to that, there’s a 100 year
life sentence for Nico Robin for possession

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:10.240
of state secrets - due to her ability to read
the poneglyphs.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:17.940
So far, that brings us to 4,171 years of rotting
away in Impel Down.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:23.290
Plenty of time for these pirates to soak in
the guilt of their actions until their dying

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.290
breath.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.139
Except perhaps the skeleton.

00:16:26.139 --> 00:16:27.170
Does he even breathe?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.990
Of course, I’ve left one crime out.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:32.220
The long-nosed one…Captain Usopp.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.380
Wait, do they have two captains?

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.780
Oh, he goes by God, now?

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:37.830
Very humble.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:43.959
Anyway, Usopp: The false reporting of a crime,
such as that pirates are attacking your village,

00:16:43.959 --> 00:16:47.680
is a misdemeanor offense punishable by up
to 1 year in prison.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:55.529
Evidently you did this every single day for
ten years, which adds up to 3,650 years in

00:16:55.529 --> 00:16:56.529
prison.

00:16:56.529 --> 00:17:03.980
This brings each of your years in the depths
of Impel Down to 7,821 years.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:09.180
Though I have heard rumors, that this man
has even allied himself with the Giants of

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:14.390
Elbaf, and so before I can dismiss this Court,
to see the true threat that these pirates

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:19.260
are, we are next going to watch this video
right here about all the things that will

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.730
happen on the island of Elbaf.

